// Failure golden: a bare `type T` component is the sealed one, and sealing is
// not elaborated yet. The decline names the component and points at what would
// elaborate it; the signature's other components are unaffected, so the refusal
// is about that member rather than about the signature.
module Bad : #{ type T, value: Integer } { def value = 1; }

//@ mode: shell
//@ expect-shell-error: abstract type component
